---
layout: layouts/hub.njk
pageTitle: Hostel Games – card games from every hostel in the world
pageDescription: Rules, strategy, cheat sheets and games against bots for the card games people play in hostels all over the world.
themeSwitchLabel: Switch between light and dark mode
---
<header class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="langbar">
      {% include "themeswitch.njk" %}
    </div>
    <h1>Hostel Games</h1>
    <p>The card games people play in hostels all over the world. Learn the rules in minutes, then play.</p>
  </div>
</header>

<main class="wrap hub">
  <h2>Games</h2>
  <ul class="games">
    {%- for game in games %}
    <li>
      <a class="game" href="/{{ game.slug }}/">
        <span class="game-name">{{ game.name }}</span>
        {%- if game.tagline %}
        <span class="game-tagline">{{ game.tagline }}</span>
        {%- endif %}
        {%- if game.languages %}
        <span class="game-meta">{{ game.languages }} languages</span>
        {%- endif %}
      </a>
    </li>
    {%- endfor %}
  </ul>
</main>

{% include "footer.njk" %}
